# happinesskeeper APP 資料存取規範

## 目的

happinesskeeper APP 需要從 Firebase 大水庫抓取多人腦波資料與報告，進行跨人共振運算。

## 腦波資料來源

所有腦波資料統一從 **Firebase BigQuery** 查詢（效率最高，支援跨人聚合）：

```
Dataset: gen-lang-client-0435688289.eeg_brainwave
Table: eeg_features   ← EEG 頻段特徵（每秒一筆）
Table: sessions       ← session 基本資料
Table: reports        ← 報告 metadata（含 gcs_report_path）
```

## 報告 PDF 取得方式

Firebase `reports` collection 的 `pdfUrl` 是不含簽名的基礎 URL：
```
https://storage.googleapis.com/brainwave-child-reports/reports/general/xxx.pdf
```
需要有效連結時，呼叫 Railway 端點：
```
GET https://backend-production-2da61.up.railway.app/api/v1/reports/session/{railway_session_id}/signed-url?days=7
Headers: Authorization: Bearer {token}
```
或直接使用 Firebase `reports` 的 `extraData.gcsPath` 自行簽署。

## 多人共振運算 API

Firebase Cloud Functions 已有現成端點：

```javascript
// 計算多人共振評分（0-100分）
POST https://...cloudfunctions.net/api/api/analytics/resonance
Headers: Authorization: Bearer {firebase_token}
Body: {
  "subjectIds": ["subject_uuid_1", "subject_uuid_2", "subject_uuid_3"],
  "bands": ["alpha", "beta", "theta", "delta", "gamma"],  // 要比對的頻段
  "days": 90  // 分析最近幾天的資料
}
// 回傳: profiles（每人腦波均值）+ pairs（兩兩共振分數）+ bestMatch

// 多人腦波摘要
GET .../api/analytics/eeg-summary?subjectIds=id1,id2,id3&days=30

// 某指標排行
GET .../api/analytics/top-subjects?metric=attention&limit=10&days=90
```

## Firebase 登入方式

```python
import requests
r = requests.post(
    "https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword",
    params={"key": "AIzaSyBc-ZEcT8fvyn-dBZ0Bhm5IsakncVp1ngQ"},
    json={"email": "YOUR_EMAIL", "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD", "returnSecureToken": True}
)
token = r.json()["idToken"]
headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}
```

## 若 happinesskeeper 也上傳腦波資料

使用標準 Firebase API：
```javascript
POST /api/eeg/batch
{
  "sessionId": "firebase_session_uuid",
  "features": [
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "windowSec": 1.0,
      "alphaRatio": 25.5,
      "betaRatio": 18.3,
      "thetaRatio": 12.1,
      "deltaRatio": 35.0,
      "gammaRatio": 9.1,
      "attentionIndex": 65.0,
      "relaxationIndex": 48.0,
      "signalQuality": 95.0,
      "isBaseline": false,
      "seqNum": 0
    }
  ]
}
```

